<title>EGYPT: Egyptian china firm profits down 41 percent.</title>
<headline>Egyptian china firm profits down 41 percent.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chini/General Pottery and China Products made attributed unaudited profits of 1.251 million pounds ($368,000) in the financial year 1995/6, 41 percent down on 2.124 million in the previous year, an official source said on Saturday. The years start on July 1.</p>
<p>The state has been trying to sell up to 60 percent of the company to an anchor investor since May and it said in August that six investors had shown interest without making bids.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
